 or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_3183_heldout.py:1-8` — Preserve independent identity regression coverage. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_3183.py:1-8` — Preserve the identity regression contract. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d_heldout.py:1-8` — Preserve independent identity regression coverage. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d.py:1-7` — Preserve the identity regression contract. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a_heldout.py:1-6` — Preserve independent AC1 identity coverage. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a.py:1-7` — Preserve AC1 identity behavior. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8_heldout.py:1-7` — Preserve independent AC7 identity coverage. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8.py:1-8` — Preserve AC7 identity behavior. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_bde5_heldout.py:1-8` — Preserve independent BDE5 identity coverage. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_bde5.py:1-7` — Preserve the BDE5 identity regression. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe_heldout.py:1-7` — Preserve independent DDBE identity coverage. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe.py:1-15` — Preserve the DDBE identity regression. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_enforce_since_grandfather.py:1-17` — Preserve enforce-since grandfathering semantics. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_gate_archived_and_unresolvable_heldout.py:1-21, 119-126` — Preserve archived and unresolvable identity handling. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_gate_scope_and_ledger.py:1-21` — Preserve identity-gate scope and audit-ledger semantics. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_perf_1cc0.py:1-14, 114-119` — Preserve bounded identity-resolution work. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d_heldout.py:1-10` — Preserve independent TS1 identity coverage. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ts1_c96d.py:1-9` — Preserve TS1 identity behavior. Consumer: test maintainers.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_identity_3183_heldout.py tests/unit/test_identity_3183.py tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d_heldout.py tests/unit/test_identity_4e9d.py tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a_heldout.py tests/unit/test_identity_ac1_401a.py tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8_heldout.py tests/unit/test_identity_ac7_bff8.py tests/unit/test_identity_bde5_heldout.py tests/unit/test_identity_bde5.py tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe_heldout.py tests/unit/test_identity_ddbe.py tests/unit/